WEBVTT

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:05.460
The Obelisk Force...

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:09.130
Academia is coming here now?

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:11.420
The winner is Yuya!

00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:16.400
The winner of the semifinals is Yuya Sakaki!

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:17.930
Listen, Yuya!

00:00:18.190 --> 00:00:21.520
During the duel, I saw these 
fishy-looking guys appear!

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:23.980
And apparently, they're after Serena.

00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:26.270
This guy named Sora went to save her...

00:00:26.270 --> 00:00:27.850
You've gotta go, too!

00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:30.120
You're done talking now, right?

00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:32.540
Crow!

00:00:32.790 --> 00:00:35.510
Don't worry about me... Hurry, Yuya!

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:37.340
Join your allies!

00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:38.310
Crow...

00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:41.020
Sorry!

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:45.660
D-Wheels.

00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:49.790
Riding duels are fought while 
racing on these machines,

00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:51.480
which are an evolution of the duel disks.

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:54.920
They combine speed and thrills for the ultimate show,

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:57.100
a symbol of freedom to all.

00:02:31.160 --> 00:02:36.000
Raid! Obelisk Force

00:02:45.430 --> 00:02:48.960
Our communicators are jammed within City.

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:54.050
Once you find the targets, use the 
signal flares to contact us.

00:02:54.640 --> 00:02:55.720
Let's begin.

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:03.160
Is that...

00:03:03.730 --> 00:03:05.360
The Obelisk Force?

00:03:05.360 --> 00:03:08.130
That's what Crow was talking about?

00:03:08.400 --> 00:03:10.680
So Academia's already in this dimension?

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:12.870
They're after Yuzu and Serena!

00:03:13.350 --> 00:03:15.690
I need to find Sora, quickly.

00:03:26.530 --> 00:03:31.460
If security wants Yuzu, they'd also try to take 
Serena to the Public Order Bureau.

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:37.240
Earlier, who were those men on the gliders?

00:03:37.240 --> 00:03:39.060
Some kind of event?

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:42.020
I haven't heard anything about an event.

00:03:42.470 --> 00:03:43.440
But either way...

00:03:43.440 --> 00:03:49.140
Everyone, did you enjoy our 
exciting performance?

00:03:50.610 --> 00:03:52.680
What was I doing?

00:03:52.680 --> 00:03:54.650
I thought I was dueling.

00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:56.210
A dream of some kind?

00:03:57.160 --> 00:04:00.190
Well, Obelisk Force's presence means

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:03.980
they're here to catch Serena and Yuzu...

00:04:06.630 --> 00:04:09.090
I found you, damn it!

00:04:16.950 --> 00:04:18.970
All troops, remain where you are.

00:04:19.330 --> 00:04:23.770
Stay on the defensive and leave 
counterattacks to Sergey.

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:30.800
Look at the beautiful performers who 
descended from the sky earlier!

00:04:31.220 --> 00:04:36.450
You say those are the fellows from the 
Fusion Dimension, from Academia?

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:40.660
Yes. The elite squadron, Obelisk Force.

00:04:40.660 --> 00:04:42.430
Incredible...

00:04:42.430 --> 00:04:46.030
Security has us surrounded below, 
and now Academia, too...

00:04:46.030 --> 00:04:49.120
No matter how superlative a duelist you may be,

00:04:49.120 --> 00:04:53.340
can you handle so many opponents?

00:04:53.670 --> 00:04:57.370
Y-You people did come here

00:04:57.370 --> 00:05:01.710
to protect us from this, didn't you?

00:05:01.710 --> 00:05:05.320
We came here to fight alongside you.

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:10.620
But with most of your membership 
sent underground,

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:14.290
the Lancers seem to have little to offer...

00:05:14.690 --> 00:05:20.030
If they knew the situation, they'd likely 
act according to their own judgment.

00:05:20.280 --> 00:05:22.000
But in exchange...

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:27.480
Now, what kind of performance will we see next?

00:05:27.480 --> 00:05:29.970
Excitement in the arena is high!

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:33.360
If they cannot determine

00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:37.640
whether the situation in which they 
find themselves is an event,

00:05:37.950 --> 00:05:40.080
it could be a good opportunity.

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:44.870
To determine whether the Synchro Dimension 
are allies that can fight with us,

00:05:44.870 --> 00:05:47.080
based on how they deal with this.

00:05:59.650 --> 00:06:00.640
Damn you...

00:06:01.410 --> 00:06:03.010
Who were you, again?

00:06:03.320 --> 00:06:04.840
I'm Hugo!

00:06:05.100 --> 00:06:08.080
Oh? You use Fusion, too?

00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:10.780
Not "Fusion"! "Hugo"!

00:06:12.440 --> 00:06:14.020
You're so funny.

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:16.760
Damn you. You're mocking me?

00:06:18.180 --> 00:06:19.290
Listen...

00:06:19.290 --> 00:06:22.840
I felt like I was dueling a little while ago.

00:06:22.840 --> 00:06:24.230
Were you my opponent?

00:06:24.230 --> 00:06:27.720
I also had a feeling like I was just dueling.

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:29.480
But who cares about that?!

00:06:29.480 --> 00:06:31.600
Take me to Rin right away!

00:06:33.030 --> 00:06:35.840
Sure, but there's a condition.

00:06:36.280 --> 00:06:37.210
A condition?

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:42.250
In exchange, tell me where Yuzu Hiiragi is.

00:06:43.760 --> 00:06:48.590
I know you've been working 
together in this dimension.

00:06:54.210 --> 00:06:55.460
Yuzu...

00:06:55.460 --> 00:06:58.030
Yuzu is... right here!

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:01.730
Are you mocking me?

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:05.470
Yuzu... Yuzu... died in the duel...

00:07:07.380 --> 00:07:09.020
So, now...

00:07:10.280 --> 00:07:13.100
But I can see her whenever I like.

00:07:13.100 --> 00:07:17.400
Because she lives on in my heart!

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:27.420
Then, I suppose Rin lives on in your heart, too.

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:30.020
Go see her whenever you like.

00:07:30.020 --> 00:07:33.100
I activate my spell card, Violet Flash!

00:07:34.680 --> 00:07:37.070
I have no more time to play with you.

00:07:37.070 --> 00:07:39.040
Wait, damn you!

00:07:46.990 --> 00:07:49.900
Sora... Serena... Where are you?

00:07:56.110 --> 00:07:58.290
At this rate, we shall eventually be found.

00:07:58.710 --> 00:07:59.880
But...

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:04.660
In this situation, moving both 
of them is impossible.

00:08:07.440 --> 00:08:09.100
This is security!

00:08:09.470 --> 00:08:12.070
This is a warning! Stop where you are!

00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:17.400
This is a warning! Stop where you are!

00:08:41.010 --> 00:08:42.590
This building...

00:08:42.590 --> 00:08:44.950
Go around the other side. Let's go.

00:08:46.340 --> 00:08:47.210
They're here!

00:08:47.810 --> 00:08:48.940
Serena?

00:08:49.440 --> 00:08:51.410
Tsukikage... Layra...

00:08:51.960 --> 00:08:54.270
Leave me here and go.

00:08:54.270 --> 00:08:55.680
Lady Serena...

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:57.020
How can you say that?

00:08:57.460 --> 00:09:00.410
The Obelisk Force and security...

00:09:00.410 --> 00:09:02.180
They're only after me.

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:04.360
You shouldn't get taken down with me.

00:09:04.360 --> 00:09:09.340
My duty was to escort you to a safe place.

00:09:09.340 --> 00:09:11.830
If I left you, that would mean nothing.

00:09:13.030 --> 00:09:16.030
Tsukikage, can you break through alone?

00:09:17.350 --> 00:09:19.450
Let the others underground know.

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:22.470
Until then, I'll protect Serena!

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:24.730
You say you will fight alone?

00:09:24.730 --> 00:09:25.440
You cannot.

00:09:25.760 --> 00:09:28.910
You are at the limits of your stamina.

00:09:29.200 --> 00:09:33.120
I'm fine. Until you can bring everyone back...

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:35.720
I'm certain this is the place.

00:09:41.200 --> 00:09:42.330
Is that...

00:09:43.830 --> 00:09:45.160
That's a signal flare!

00:09:49.460 --> 00:09:50.570
They found us?

00:09:52.390 --> 00:09:55.410
I won't let them have Serena!

00:10:01.010 --> 00:10:04.240
Impossible... He's taken this many down alone?

00:10:04.240 --> 00:10:05.350
Is he a monster?

00:10:13.360 --> 00:10:17.180
Magnificent. He's holding Academia at bay.

00:10:17.180 --> 00:10:22.170
Chairman, perhaps we should make peace 
with Roget and get him on our side.

00:10:30.580 --> 00:10:33.540
One... two... three of them.

00:10:34.070 --> 00:10:37.190
If I cannot shake them, they will learn 
of the underground facility.

00:10:39.640 --> 00:10:40.900
I have no choice.

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:45.420
Scum. You know Yuzu Hiiragi's 
whereabouts, don't you?

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:50.070
I guess you won't tell me, huh?

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:01.870
Do you trust me a little now?

00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:05.010
Master Layra, for now, stand firm!

00:11:08.340 --> 00:11:10.350
Field Spell Crossover.

00:11:10.760 --> 00:11:11.780
Duel!

00:11:17.980 --> 00:11:19.790
I'll take the first turn.

00:11:19.790 --> 00:11:23.490
I summon Ancient Gear Hunting 
Hound from my hand!

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:30.310
I set one card and end my turn.

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:32.570
My turn!

00:11:34.530 --> 00:11:39.910
I activate my spell card Ninjitsu Art of 
Hazy Duplication from my hand!

00:11:41.880 --> 00:11:45.850
I can Special Summon one Ninja, 
Level 4 or below, from my hand.

00:11:45.850 --> 00:11:48.820
Take the field, Twilight Ninja Shingetsu!

00:11:49.120 --> 00:11:54.860
By tributing one Ninja on my side of the field, 
my next card can be Tribute Summoned.

00:11:54.860 --> 00:11:56.790
I tribute Shingetsu.

00:11:57.700 --> 00:12:01.510
Take the field, Twilight Ninja Getsuga, the Shogun!

00:12:04.360 --> 00:12:05.580
Battle.

00:12:05.580 --> 00:12:08.570
Getsuga attacks Ancient Gear Hunting Hound!

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:15.510
I activate my Continuous Trap Fusion Trench.

00:12:15.980 --> 00:12:21.510
Its effect forbids all monsters, except for 
Fusion Monsters, from attacking.

00:12:25.600 --> 00:12:28.710
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:32.440
Now, you can't attack at all.

00:12:32.440 --> 00:12:34.870
We'll crush you on our turns.

00:12:35.200 --> 00:12:36.550
My turn!

00:12:37.580 --> 00:12:41.040
I activate my spell card 
Polymerization from my hand.

00:12:41.410 --> 00:12:45.640
I fuse the three Ancient Gear 
Hunting Hounds from my hand!

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:50.010
Mechanical hunting dogs who 
inherit the souls of antiquity,

00:12:50.010 --> 00:12:54.390
snap at each other and be 
reborn with new power!

00:12:54.670 --> 00:12:55.850
Fusion Summon!

00:12:56.280 --> 00:13:01.120
Appear, Level 7 Triple Ancient 
Gear Hunting Hound!

00:13:03.330 --> 00:13:06.040
I activate the effect of Fusion Trench.

00:13:06.040 --> 00:13:11.070
When I haven't summoned or Special 
Summoned a non-Fusion Monster,

00:13:11.070 --> 00:13:14.310
one Fusion Monster can attack directly.

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:16.760
Battle!

00:13:16.760 --> 00:13:20.890
I attack directly with Triple Ancient 
Gear Hunting Hound!

00:13:22.810 --> 00:13:25.000
When this card attacks,

00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:30.140
you can't activate spell or trap cards 
until the Damage Step ends!

00:13:35.130 --> 00:13:37.050
I end my turn.

00:13:37.050 --> 00:13:41.600
Before we have to turn you into a card, 
why not tell us where Yuzu Hiiragi is?

00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:48.260
I see. Then, we'll just have to crush you, 
and take the information by force.

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:49.770
My turn!

00:13:49.770 --> 00:13:53.240
I activate my spell card 
Polymerization from my hand.

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:56.950
I fuse three Ancient Gear Hunting Hounds.

00:13:57.710 --> 00:13:58.850
Fusion Summon!

00:13:59.240 --> 00:14:05.060
Appear, Level 7 Triple Ancient 
Gear Hunting Hound!

00:14:07.880 --> 00:14:10.280
Prepare for a repetition of last turn.

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:12.300
History does repeat itself.

00:14:12.650 --> 00:14:16.370
Fusion Trench's effect lets me attack directly!

00:14:26.750 --> 00:14:28.570
I now end my turn.

00:14:28.570 --> 00:14:30.320
Let me warn you ahead of time.

00:14:30.320 --> 00:14:33.180
When you have monsters on 
your side of the field,

00:14:33.180 --> 00:14:37.240
the effect of Ancient Gear 
Hunting Hound on my field

00:14:37.240 --> 00:14:40.160
allows me to deal you 600 points of damage.

00:14:40.550 --> 00:14:43.230
You have 400 life remaining.

00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:46.360
In other words, on our next turn, 
it will be all over.

00:14:46.360 --> 00:14:49.570
I'll ask you once more. Where is Yuzu Hiiragi?

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:54.340
Even if you kill me, I would never tell you!

00:14:54.340 --> 00:14:57.340
I see... Then I have no more use for you.

00:14:57.340 --> 00:14:58.440
I'll turn you into a card.

00:14:58.440 --> 00:14:59.960
My turn!

00:15:05.430 --> 00:15:08.010
2000-point penalty for entering battle.

00:15:11.420 --> 00:15:13.470
You're Sora Shiunin!

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:15.290
Turning against Academia?

00:15:15.290 --> 00:15:17.760
You are helping me?

00:15:17.760 --> 00:15:20.730
Continuous Spell Frightfur Sanctuary!

00:15:21.400 --> 00:15:24.750
This card can be activated, 
when I send one card

00:15:24.750 --> 00:15:28.210
from my hand, and two Frightfur monsters 
from my Extra Deck, to the graveyard.

00:15:28.640 --> 00:15:31.500
I send Edge Imp Frightfuloid from my hand,

00:15:31.500 --> 00:15:36.910
and Frightfur Bear and Frightfur Leo from 
my Extra Deck, to the graveyard.

00:15:37.740 --> 00:15:42.600
While in the graveyard, Edge Imp Frightfuloid 
is treated as a Frightfur monster.

00:15:42.600 --> 00:15:46.490
And I activate my spell card Frightfur Fusion!

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:51.040
By banishing Edge Imp Frightfuloid, Frightfur Bear,

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:55.470
and Frightfur Leo in my graveyard, 
I can Fusion Summon!

00:15:55.960 --> 00:15:58.320
The inanimate toy that houses the devil,

00:15:58.320 --> 00:16:01.080
annihilate the fools who oppose me!

00:16:01.440 --> 00:16:03.170
Fusion Summon!

00:16:04.080 --> 00:16:08.010
Appear, the magical beast that's 
a combination of all toys!

00:16:08.010 --> 00:16:10.480
Frightfur Chimera!

00:16:14.400 --> 00:16:16.090
2800 attack points?

00:16:16.460 --> 00:16:17.720
It isn't over yet.

00:16:17.720 --> 00:16:20.120
I activate my spell card Polymerization!

00:16:20.530 --> 00:16:24.060
I fuse Fluffal Bear and Edge Imp 
Sabres in my hand!

00:16:24.680 --> 00:16:27.760
Devil's claws and beast's fangs...

00:16:27.760 --> 00:16:32.900
Become one in the whirlpool of mystery!
 Show your new power and look!

00:16:32.900 --> 00:16:34.640
Fusion Summon!

00:16:35.020 --> 00:16:39.640
Appear, the magical forest beast 
that tears through everything,

00:16:39.640 --> 00:16:42.010
Frightfur Tiger!

00:16:44.360 --> 00:16:46.970
When I successfully summon this card,

00:16:46.970 --> 00:16:51.160
I can destroy as many cards as 
I used for fusion components.

00:16:51.160 --> 00:16:53.530
I destroy Fusion Trench!

00:16:57.470 --> 00:17:01.000
It's not over yet. I activate Frightfur Tiger's effect.

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:03.640
As long as this card is in my Monster Zone,

00:17:03.640 --> 00:17:08.670
its attack points increase by the number of 
Frightfur monsters on my field times 300.

00:17:09.010 --> 00:17:11.140
There are two Frightfurs on the field.

00:17:14.680 --> 00:17:19.520
Then, I activate my trap card Barrier 
Ninjitsu Art of Transcription!

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:28.380
I can bestow one monster on the field with the 
effect of one of my opponent's monsters,

00:17:28.380 --> 00:17:29.930
until the next End Phase.

00:17:30.330 --> 00:17:35.270
I grant Triple Ancient Gear Hunting 
Hound's effect to Frightfur Chimera.

00:17:37.560 --> 00:17:43.140
During the Battle Phase, Triple Hunting Hound 
can attack a monster three times.

00:17:44.540 --> 00:17:46.840
Time is scarce. Hurry.

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:49.310
Battle!

00:17:49.310 --> 00:17:53.720
Frightfur Chimera, attack the 
first Triple Hunting Hound!

00:18:02.460 --> 00:18:05.020
Frightfur Chimera's attack activates.

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:07.150
When it destroys one of your monsters by battle,

00:18:07.150 --> 00:18:09.800
I can Special Summon that monster to my field.

00:18:10.170 --> 00:18:12.920
Come, Triple Hunting Hound!

00:18:16.190 --> 00:18:17.740
What?!

00:18:17.740 --> 00:18:20.730
And for each monster I take control of,

00:18:20.730 --> 00:18:24.410
Frightfur Chimera's attack points increase by 300.

00:18:25.420 --> 00:18:29.100
And Continuous Spell Frightfur Sanctuary's effect

00:18:29.100 --> 00:18:34.390
allows the Fusion Monster Triple Hunting Hound 
to be treated as a Frightfur monster.

00:18:34.780 --> 00:18:37.820
Frightfur Tiger's effect increases its attack points!

00:18:41.160 --> 00:18:43.100
4000 attack points?

00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:44.440
Battle!

00:18:44.440 --> 00:18:50.460
Frightfur Chimera attacks the second 
Triple Ancient Gear Hunting Hound!

00:18:59.920 --> 00:19:04.910
Frightfur Chimera's effect lets me Special 
Summon the Triple Hound I destroyed.

00:19:04.910 --> 00:19:09.050
And that further increases the attack 
points of Frightfur Chimera.

00:19:11.130 --> 00:19:14.600
The effects of Frightfur Sanctuary 
and Frightfur Tiger

00:19:14.860 --> 00:19:18.620
further increase the attack points 
of Frightfurs on the field.

00:19:20.170 --> 00:19:22.920
Here we go... The third battle!

00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:26.380
Frightfur Chimera attacks Ancient 
Gear Hunting Hound!

00:19:32.750 --> 00:19:34.270
Impossible...

00:19:37.450 --> 00:19:42.140
Frightfur Chimera's effect allows me to Special 
Summon the destroyed Hunting Hound.

00:19:47.380 --> 00:19:52.930
Hunting Hound wasn't Fusion Summoned, 
so it's unaffected by Frightfur Sanctuary.

00:19:52.930 --> 00:19:54.400
Aren't you glad?

00:19:54.400 --> 00:19:58.880
That means it doesn't raise my 
monsters' attack points more.

00:19:58.880 --> 00:20:02.850
Ridiculous... He has five monsters 
on his side of the field.

00:20:03.100 --> 00:20:05.050
And our fields are wide open...

00:20:05.500 --> 00:20:07.750
One, two, three.

00:20:07.750 --> 00:20:10.760
And I got three monsters from you guys, too.

00:20:13.290 --> 00:20:16.260
Fall by the fangs of your own monsters!

00:20:32.820 --> 00:20:33.800
I don't expect

00:20:33.800 --> 00:20:38.420
this will suffice for you to forgive me 
for turning your brother into a card.

00:20:41.740 --> 00:20:46.000
I shall not press my grudge. 
That is the way of the shinobi.

00:20:46.000 --> 00:20:47.390
I thank you for your aid.

00:20:48.850 --> 00:20:52.230
We don't have much time to talk. 
Do you know where Serena is?

00:20:52.560 --> 00:20:55.570
Academia has discovered Lady Serena.

00:20:56.160 --> 00:20:59.230
Lady Serena has been paralyzed 
with a tranquilizer.

00:20:59.230 --> 00:21:02.040
Master Layra is currently fighting to defend her.

00:21:02.300 --> 00:21:03.630
What?

00:21:03.630 --> 00:21:05.640
Then, that signal flare before...

00:21:05.930 --> 00:21:08.960
I was just on my way to fetch reinforcements.

00:21:08.960 --> 00:21:10.060
Got it.

00:21:10.060 --> 00:21:12.780
I'm going to save Serena and Layra.

00:21:12.780 --> 00:21:15.100
You get help from the others.

00:21:30.170 --> 00:21:32.170
They just keep coming...

00:21:50.740 --> 00:21:51.770
Layra...

00:21:59.640 --> 00:22:02.180
Layra... Layra!

00:22:03.330 --> 00:22:04.410
Layra!

00:22:05.070 --> 00:22:08.520
Layra!

00:22:09.510 --> 00:22:11.740
Yuya...

00:23:49.540 --> 00:23:52.940
Tsukikage! Is it true that 
Academia has appeared?

00:23:53.200 --> 00:23:56.650
Indeed. Master Layra is currently 
fighting on his own.

00:23:56.650 --> 00:23:58.430
You must come to save him.

00:23:58.430 --> 00:24:01.880
My allies, the time has come at last.

00:24:01.880 --> 00:24:05.200
We'll set right the years of discrimination 
and oppression by the Tops,

00:24:05.200 --> 00:24:08.580
and raise the signal flare of rebellion!

00:24:08.580 --> 00:24:11.830
Let's go! The revolution begins!

00:24:12.470 --> 00:24:16.100
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
The Signal Flare of Revolution.

00:24:16.100 --> 00:24:17.880
The fun is only getting started!
